      "verified_by": "a_tailcall_root_prewrite_obligation",
      "fine_trace_step": 9,
      "description": "Root cause. The stack/GC check that can still re-enter Lua or raise `stack overflow` runs only after `luaD_pretailcall()` has already copied the callee closure and arguments into the reused caller frame. If it raises on that path, `ci_func(ci)->p` now names the callee while `ci->u.l.savedpc` still names the caller instruction."
    },
