      "fine_trace_step": 12,
      "description": "ASan crash site. `luaG_getfuncline()` walks the callee `Proto`'s `lineinfo` array with an out-of-range `pc` derived from the mismatched `CallInfo`, so this load reads past the 19-byte heap allocation created for that `lineinfo` vector."
